<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sri Sai Tours & Travels</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f5f5f5;
            color: #222;
        }

        header {
            background: #111;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
        }

        header p {
            margin-top: 8px;
            color: #ddd;
        }

        .hero {
            padding: 80px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            background: white;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 42px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 25px;
            background: #111;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 5px;
        }

        .section {
            padding: 50px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .section h2 {
            font-size: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .cards {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            width: 280px;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        footer {
            background: #111;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero h2 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Sri Sai Tours & Travels</h1>
    <p>Travel • Tours • Comfortable Journeys</p>
</header>

<section class="hero">
    <h2>Your Journey, Our Responsibility</h2>
    <p>Premium travel services for family, corporate and group journeys.</p>

    <a href="#contact" class="button">Book Now</a>
    <a href="#vehicles" class="button">Our Vehicles</a>
</section>

<section class="section" id="vehicles">
    <h2>Our Vehicles</h2>

    <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Premium Urbania</h3>
            <p>Comfortable premium travel for families, VIP groups and corporate journeys.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Luxury Buses</h3>
            <p>Spacious buses suitable for tours, pilgrimages and large groups.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Tour Services</h3>
            <p>Reliable transportation for long-distance tours and special trips.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <h2>Why Choose Us?</h2>

    <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Comfort</h3>
            <p>Travel comfortably with well-maintained vehicles.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Reliable Service</h3>
            <p>Professional service focused on safe and smooth journeys.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Group Travel</h3>
            <p>Perfect for families, corporate groups and pilgrimages.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="contact">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>Contact Sri Sai Tours & Travels for your next journey.</p>

    <br>

    <a href="tel:+919849255511" class="button">📞 Call Us</a>

    <a href="https://wa.me/919849255511" class="button">
        💬 WhatsApp
    </a>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Sri Sai Tours & Travels. All Rights Reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
